"sdp.overview.projectMgmt.milestoneTasks.content" : "<p>Bir proje, kilometre ta\u015flar\u0131 ad\u0131 verilen birden \u00e7ok mant\u0131ksal ad\u0131ma b\u00f6l\u00fcnebilir. Her kilometre ta\u015f\u0131, g\u00f6revlere b\u00f6l\u00fcnebilir ve \u00e7e\u015fitli teknisyenlere atanabilir. G\u00f6rev ba\u011f\u0131ml\u0131l\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 yap\u0131land\u0131rarak, t\u00fcm bu g\u00f6revlerin do\u011fru \u015fekilde y\u00fcr\u00fct\u00fclmesini sa\u011flayabilirsiniz. Tahmin \u00e7abaya kar\u015f\u0131 proje i\u00e7in harcanan genel \u00e7abay\u0131 anlamak i\u00e7in her g\u00f6rev \u00fczerinde harcanan s\u00fcreyi de kaydedebilirsiniz.</p>",
