"sdp.purchase.reconcile.example" : "\u00d6rne\u011fin bir Al\u0131m Emrinden varl\u0131k al\u0131rken, al\u0131nan kayna\u011f\u0131n ad\u0131 Sistem taraf\u0131ndan belirlenir. Bu kaynak fiziksel a\u011fdan taran\u0131rken, kaynak ad\u0131 kaynaktaki gibi ayarlan\u0131r. Sistemin \u00fcretti\u011fi kayna\u011f\u0131 kopyalamak i\u00e7in, her iki kayna\u011f\u0131 se\u00e7in ve Ba\u011fda\u015ft\u0131r d\u00fc\u011fmesini t\u0131klat\u0131n. Ba\u011fda\u015ft\u0131r, Al\u0131m Emrinden al\u0131nan kayna\u011f\u0131n verilerini, a\u011fdan taranan kayna\u011fa kopyalar ve Al\u0131m Emrinden al\u0131nan kayna\u011f\u0131 siler. Bu se\u00e7enek, a\u011fdan taranan iki kayna\u011f\u0131 birle\u015ftirmek i\u00e7in de kullan\u0131labilir. Bu durumda, son eklenen kaynak korunur.",
